        <div class="ln"><span class="gr">$</span> cat recent-work</div>
        <div class="ln"><span class="yl">cisnet</span> <span class="dim">seo:</span> 3× organic in 16 months</div>
        <div class="ln"><span class="yl">orbit</span> <span class="dim">build:</span> dual-channel AI voice agent, live</div>
        <div class="ln"><span class="yl">cisnet</span> <span class="dim">migrate:</span> 70+ URLs preserved through cutover</div>
        <div class="ln"><span class="gr">$</span> ls ~/services</div>
