<!-- ===== SERVICES ===== -->
<section class="section" id="services">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <div class="title-block">
      <div class="label">what i do</div>
      <h2>How I work with clients.</h2>
      <p>Every engagement is fixed-scope with a written quote before signing. Five shapes cover it: the free Scoping Call, the Audit, the Sprint, the Custom build, and the Ops Retainer. <a href="/services/">Full breakdown →</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="services-grid">

    <div class="service-card reveal">
      <div class="head">
        <span class="id"><span class="num">00 ·</span> SCOPING CALL</span>
        <span class="price">30 MIN · BY APPOINTMENT</span>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>30-minute scoping call.</h3>
        <p>The starting point for every paid engagement. I walk you through one workflow, sharpen the scope, and determine which paid shape is the right fit. The call is free.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>One workflow discussed in detail</li>
          <li>A direct read on whether AI is the right fix</li>
          <li>A written quote within 24 hours when there is a fit</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="foot">
        <span class="meta">FREE</span>
        <a href="/contact/" class="cta">→ BOOK CALL</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-card featured reveal" data-delay="1">
      <div class="head">
        <span class="id"><span class="num">01 ·</span> SYSTEM AUDIT</span>
        <span class="price">FIXED-SCOPE WEEK</span>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>System audit.</h3>
        <p>A fixed-scope week structured around founder interviews and a workflow review, focused on the 3-5 highest-impact automation opportunities for the business. The deliverable is a ranked opportunity list and a 30-day implementation plan.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Three founder interviews, 60 minutes each</li>
          <li>Current-state workflow map across the operation</li>
          <li>Ranked opportunity list scored on effort and impact</li>
          <li>A 30-day implementation plan with cost projections per opportunity</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="foot">
        <span class="meta">QUOTE ON SCOPE · AVAILABLE</span>
        <a href="/services/" class="cta">→ BOOK AUDIT</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-card reveal" data-delay="2">
      <div class="head">
        <span class="id"><span class="num">02 ·</span> BUILD SPRINT</span>
        <span class="price">FIXED-SCOPE BUILD</span>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>Build sprint.</h3>
        <p>One workflow with a clearly defined input and output. Scope locks at signing. The workflow is deployed and documented by the end of the sprint window. If the requirement can't be stated in one sentence, a Custom build is the right shape instead.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>A single workflow with a defined input and output</li>
          <li>Deployment on the client's Vercel account (or mine, transferred at close)</li>
          <li>README, architecture diagram, and a 15-minute handoff walkthrough</li>
          <li>14 days of post-launch bug fixes included; client owns the code outright</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="foot">
        <span class="meta">FIXED PRICE · FROM $2,500</span>
        <a href="/services/" class="cta">→ BOOK SPRINT</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-card reveal" data-delay="3">
      <div class="head">
        <span class="id"><span class="num">03 ·</span> CUSTOM BUILD</span>
        <span class="price">QUOTE-BASED</span>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>Custom build.</h3>
        <p>For multi-workflow systems that exceed the scope of a Sprint: content engines, custom MCP servers, marketing sites with full SEO and admin infrastructure, multi-step lead pipelines. Milestone-paid with a written specification agreed before signing.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>30-minute scoping call followed by a written specification</li>
          <li>Milestone-based delivery with a demo at each milestone</li>
          <li>Built on the client's stack or my recommended stack, depending on fit</li>
          <li>Full source code and 30 days of post-launch fixes included</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="foot">
        <span class="meta">QUOTE ON SCOPE · MILESTONE-PAID</span>
        <a href="/services/" class="cta">→ START SCOPING</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="services-cta reveal">
    <a href="/services/">See all services and pricing →</a>
  </div>
</section>

